  "prefLabel": "Ncr 541.01 Permit Required to Float Timber on Surface Waters",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 541.01 Permit Required to Float Timber on Surface Waters. Permission from the director shall be required to float timber on the surface water of the state, pursuant to RSA 485‑B:1-a. At least 30 days prior, all landowners, authorized agents, or owners of timber to be floated on surface waters of the state, shall apply for a permit by completing and submitting Form 540, as described in Ncr 541.02.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5401.01), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr520-590.html"
